  displayName: Redcap
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a65d4e66b70648c438264da746989c94, type: 3}
  description: Redcaps are small fae killers, squat and vicious, often wearing a
    stained cap and carrying a crude weapon. They move in fast bursts of anger, rushing
    victims with sudden, violent intent. They use harsh, cruel speech, spitting threats
    and taunts mid-charge, as if words are just another way to wound.
